<title>SWEDEN: Swedish OM Gruppen to drop off main list.</title>
<headline>Swedish OM Gruppen to drop off main list.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish financial group OM Gruppen AB said on Thursday it would delist its shares from the Stockholm Stock Exchange's main A list and apply for a listing on the bourse's smaller O list because of a new tax law.</p>
</text>
